{
    "background_story": "Punk, the infamous pirate captain, had a secret obsession - cleanliness. Every week, on the designated 'washday', Punk would drop anchor in a secluded cove and order his crew to scrub the decks and swab the sails. But it wasn't just the ship that got a good cleaning - Punk would also insist on washing his prized possessions, including his favorite leather boots and trusty cutlass. The crew would grumble and complain, but Punk wouldn't budge. He believed that a clean ship and clean gear were essential to a successful plundering expedition. And, as it turned out, Punk's attention to detail paid off - his ship, the 'Maverick's Revenge', was always the most feared and respected on the high seas. Washday was a ritual that brought Punk a sense of calm and focus, preparing him for the adventures that lay ahead.",
